<p>Put all of your strength into your weapon blows, creating shockwaves that deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">35%, 43%, 48%, 52%, 55%</acronym> Physical weapon damage to all nearby targets.  Only one shockwave will be created per action, and the primary target does not take extra damage.</p><p>Each shattering impact will drain 8 stamina.</p>